PARITY NOTES (web BulkActionsToolbar.tsx -> native)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Gate `if (count === 0) return null` -> projection `.empty` (rendered as a friendly empty state,
  never a blank box — P4 leaf contract).
- `t('bulk.selected', {count})` `{{count}} selected` -> BulkActionsFormat.countLabel (i18next
  interpolation ported). `aria-live="polite"` -> the count chip group is one VoiceOver element
  (selection summary) with .updatesFrequently.
- `itemNoun ? (count===1?one:other) : t('bulk.itemDefault','item')` + the `of {{total}}` suffix,
  both shown only when itemNoun is provided (web conditional render) -> BulkActionsFormat.noun /
  totalLabel + the nounText/totalText gating in the projection.
- Per-action `<Button variant=danger|secondary size=sm icon loading={pending} disabled={disabled||
  pending}>` + `data-bulk-action={id}` -> BulkActionButton over TSButton(.destructive/.secondary,
  .small, isLoading) with .disabled + .accessibilityIdentifier("bulk-action-{id}").
- `runAction`: ignore while pending -> in-flight guard; `confirm` -> the native `pendingConfirm` +
  `.confirmationDialog` (web `useConfirm`/`<ConfirmDialog>`, danger=destructive role); the await +
  finally drive the per-action spinner.
- Ghost Clear `<Button>` + `data-bulk-action="clear"` -> BulkActionsClearButton wired to onClear
  (web onClear + the Escape key) with .accessibilityIdentifier("bulk-action-clear").
- selectedIds `Array<string | number>` -> BulkSelectionID enum (string/int), lossless.
- States loading/empty/error reproduced; stale/offline freshness chip with one-shot auto-refresh.
- Binds the P1/S8 state-holder seam (BulkActionsToolbarModel + BulkActionsToolbarSource); no HTTP in
  the view. view.opened (P1/S11) emitted once with slug "BulkActionsToolbar".
- Sticky/z-index is the host scroll view's concern (a CSS positioning detail); the surface renders
  the bar. The atomic shared Button/ConfirmDialog/GlassPanel are the component-library bundle —
  OUT OF SCOPE here and left untouched.

